{
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "**The problem.** Given the `root` of a binary search tree and two integers `low` and `high`, return the **sum of every value in the range [low, high]**, inclusive."
    },
    {
      "type": "drawing",
      "src": "/drawings/f5c5bcf4-6a6b-42e0-b8fa-3b845b7cea6c.svg",
      "alt": "The tree 10, 5, 15, 3, 7, null, 18 with low 7 and high 15. The values in range are 7, 10 and 15, which sum to 32. Node 3 is too small, so its left subtree can be skipped; 18 is too big, so its right subtree can be skipped.",
      "width": 723,
      "height": 410,
